{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"_kritt_extractor_helper\":true,\"stub\":true,\"stub_explanation\":\"No concrete vulnerability is supported in this flow. The immutable wrapper authenticates callbacks, and requester-controlled timing cannot bypass the two-day cutoff. Late callbacks preserve state and accounting; permissionless enableRefunds becomes available at the same deadline, and Refunding blocks subsequent resolution.\",\"results\":[]}"}}
